msgstr "\\nCan I connect more than one service account?\\n"

msgid "\\nYes — drop as many JSON keys as you like in the Connections tab and pick which one each form binding should use.\\n"
msgstr "\\nYes — drop as many JSON keys as you like in the Connections tab and pick which one each form binding should use.\\n"

