msgstr "\\nCan I choose which field goes to which column?\\n"

msgid "\\nYes. In the binding wizard’s<strong>Columns & Fields</strong>step, drag rows (or use ▲▼) to set the order, rename each column header, and toggle any field off to skip it. The A/B/C badge shows exactly where each field lands.\\n"
msgstr "\\nYes. In the binding wizard’s<strong>Columns & Fields</strong>step, drag rows (or use ▲▼) to set the order, rename each column header, and toggle any field off to skip it. The A/B/C badge shows exactly where each field lands.\\n"

